  <acceptance-criteria>
    <criterion testable="true">Both field-mapping docs state fill-only create, push Copy-only by Manual Refresh sync mode, the quick-view advice and the "no OOB relationship mappings on rule-owned fields" rule; none mentions a client mapping engine as current.</criterion>
    <criterion testable="true">Registry rows I-3 and I-5 read done and I-6 reflects the record-first owner rule and points at the matrix.</criterion>
    <criterion testable="true">Root CLAUDE.md §17 Field Mapping row and §13 entry point updated and a matching `.claude/CHANGELOG.md` entry exists; both edits were made by the main session.</criterion>
    <criterion testable="true">Negative: no content from PR #1911 or #2110 was removed from the write-path doc, and no sub-agent wrote under `.claude/` (git diff reviewed).</criterion>
    <criterion testable="true">Docs merged to the working branch with no conflict markers and all cross-links resolve.</criterion>
  </acceptance-criteria>

